title: "Disk Doctor Reference"
abstract: >-
  An independent, safety-oriented AI Agent reference implementation based on
  observable behavior, deterministic policy enforcement, and constrained
  execution. The project documents which parts are replicated from observation,
  which are inferred, and which are substituted with original designs.
